              <dl>
                <div><dt>When it runs</dt><dd>When Henry asks whether a plan, feature, business idea, or workflow makes sense.</dd></div>
                <div><dt>What it connects to</dt><dd>The proposal, market or customer context, constraints, prior decisions, evidence sources, and relevant operator skills.</dd></div>
                <div><dt>What Henry gets back</dt><dd>What is strong, what is vague, what will break, what to test first, and the smallest next move.</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Where the human stays in charge</dt><dd>Critique and planning are safe. Starting external work, assigning people, spending money, or making commitments requires confirmation.</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </article>
