      <section class="shell setup" aria-labelledby="setup-title">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Setup pattern</p><h2 id="setup-title">Copy the operating shape</h2><p>Use the atlas like a pattern library. Pick a repeated job, connect safe sources, define the returned artifact, and write the approval gate before automating anything.</p></div>
        <ol><li>Choose one card that matches the repeated job.</li><li>Replace the connected sources with systems the operator can safely read.</li><li>Define the output format before the agent runs.</li><li>Keep the human gate explicit, especially for external sends, spend, production, and commitments.</li><li>Save receipts so the result can be checked instead of believed.</li></ol>
      </section>
